			"start": 940,
			"end": 958
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " a `new` the author wrote with TYPE ARGUMENTS ends its slice at `>`, so the pair goes",
			"start": 975,
			"end": 1062
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " around it wherever the tail's first token JOINS that `>`: bare, `new DD<T> + 1` reads",
			"start": 1064,
			"end": 1152
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " as `((new DD) < T) > +1`, and `[0]` rebinds through the same relational reading",
			"start": 1154,
			"end": 1236
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
